/src/generated/prisma

# TypeScript incremental build cache. Machine-specific, and a stale copy has
# already caused the build to disagree with the source once.
*.tsbuildinfo

# AI assistant tooling: per-tool configuration and vendored skill packs, restored
# locally by `prisma skills sync`. None of it is needed to build, test or run
# Fangoo. The project's own .agents/skills/fangoo-project stays tracked.
.claude/
.cursor/
.devin/
.windsurf/
skills-lock.json
.agents/skills/prisma-*/
